> Abstract：In recent years O2O industry shows a rapid[ development in our] country. O2O mode has been accepted by many industries and introduced in the logistics industry. By using the O2[O mode] effectivelysolve the cargo allocation problems, the high empty loading rate of lorry and the highly logistics costs, etc. in the[ logistics] industry, which isgreatly promote the health and velocity in the[ logistics] industry in our country. But logistics O2[O] mode in our country still exists many problems[ in the] process of development, such as false information, payment, etc.
