> The OTR 1840 is a CWDM Fiber Optic to[ SD]I transmitter and receiver combined in a compact self contained package. It is a convenient and cost effective solution to combat the restrictions involved[ with] the distribution of uncompressed broadcast quality video signals over long distances.
Each O[TR 1840 CWDM] tranceiver has an independant transmitter and receiver channel, which provides an effective solution for any SDI signal up to 1080p60[ (]3Gbit/s) while preserving full uncompressed quality. Select from 18 transmitter wavelengths for full CWDM compatibility (ITU-T G.694.2).
The OTR 1840 will auto-detect and[ re]-clock any 270Mbit / 1.5Gbit and 3Gbit SDI source prior to[ conversion]. The module is fully compatible with 3Gbit Level A and Level B formats.[][][][][][][][][][][][][][]


